071f40e6-c400-4f01-a1c6-cf0d93cec0e5	Giày thể thao đế cao dành cho nữ	giay-the-thao-de-cao-danh-cho-nu-i0k7jw	Mô tả :Giày thể thao đế cao dành cho nữ, mang phong cách trẻ trung và hiện đại. Thiết kế lưới màu trắng thoáng khí, giúp đôi chân luôn khô thoáng và dễ chịu khi vận động. Phần gót độn khéo léo giúp tôn dáng, tạo cảm giác cao ráo mà vẫn êm ái khi di chuyển. Phù hợp cho đi học, đi chơi hay dạo phố, dễ phối với nhiều trang phục. Phong cách thời trang kết hợp tính năng động cho phái nữ.\nMàu sắc: trắng, đen\nChất liệu cao cấp, kiểu dáng thiết kế xu hướng thời trang mang lại sự thoải mái, thanh lịch và thời thượng.	0ecddf00-9df1-4fa3-952e-960cd640ff5f	[-0.7015546,0.4625021,-2.7709744,-1.1345781,0.88824314,-0.51836896,1.4550962,-0.938605,-1.1906688,0.41262484,-1.4725537,0.6743811,0.5251405,-0.16519655,1.3627542,-0.7142091,-0.42958954,-1.0934365,-0.6537399,2.1667771,-1.6790297,0.7299598,-0.10145015,-1.6650348,0.93358886,0.4073773,-0.63651055,0.47386205,-0.16774318,-0.4996035,0.22025967,0.77758366,-0.009915491,0.57047874,-0.5688236,-1.1213691,0.4008422,0.3305139,0.7800464,0.73080754,1.8354479,0.44772452,0.53899246,-0.28086472,0.37850434,0.12460999,-1.0905745,1.1236169,0.81115013,-1.325297,-0.7298836,0.57619554,0.68776035,-1.1405873,1.2623051,-0.12955414,0.23059036,-1.4908493,-0.23334491,-0.20239593,0.7684641,1.8641778,-0.78484833,1.112946,0.521662,-0.66880995,-0.32797036,1.9970666,0.050638344,-0.7806373,0.37582073,-0.18709067,-0.1799715,0.48654267,-0.55635107,-1.0690664,0.24798954,-0.73585635,1.048177,-0.09702122,-0.46580517,-0.51521647,1.5982633,0.46747872,0.32097253,-0.10217418,-0.2950406,0.3845464,-1.7295277,1.0551997,-0.33059573,0.21413884,0.08902377,0.26840875,-0.45833036,1.2013551,-0.0476987,0.6921601,-0.9826441,-0.2578835,-1.0324366,-0.5852764,0.18989283,0.1105479,-0.39856982,1.3481443,-0.5353358,0.9891103,-1.2484267,-0.42659953,1.0801319,1.6277893,-0.56434625,0.15388556,0.5402586,-0.52439755,0.88451505,1.0129126,0.5928929,1.0946108,-1.1975842,-0.089371726,-0