cc9f0adb-1cd7-46a9-bc5e-74733adfb16c	Váy thiết kế thanh lịch và tinh tế	vay-thiet-ke-thanh-lich-va-tinh-te-j5hv4v	Chiếc váy của Mo Han Yi Mei sở hữu thiết kế thanh lịch và tinh tế, mang phong cách hiện đại. Điểm nhấn nổi bật ở phần eo được xử lý khéo léo giúp tôn dáng và tạo cảm giác thon gọn hơn khi mặc. Chất liệu mềm mại, thoáng mát mang lại sự thoải mái suốt cả ngày. Kiểu dáng nữ tính, dễ phối cùng giày cao gót hoặc phụ kiện tối giản để tạo nên vẻ ngoài sang trọng và cuốn hút.\nMàu sắc: trắng nhạt\nChất liệu cao cấp, kiểu dáng thiết kế xu hướng thời trang mang lại sự thoải mái, thanh lịch và thời thượng.	c1469243-f1d4-42e6-90da-1664a015cdfc	[-0.38545644,-0.016735395,-3.4423268,-1.1023898,0.5167417,-0.35893804,0.60209465,-0.46607876,-0.80244124,0.50483614,-0.7291282,1.7517631,0.2423601,-0.39886886,1.02854,-0.22236563,-0.2713673,-0.82342744,-0.28926286,1.9251124,-0.9514119,0.4824647,-0.20771252,-1.5874362,0.42135787,-0.3403749,-0.3551301,-0.119271636,0.05862518,-0.9876563,0.7901029,-0.033440545,-0.68086225,-0.07972323,-0.6801021,-1.0851271,0.27481577,0.99898523,1.0659392,0.67152685,1.5938559,0.43360442,0.6218708,-0.90576863,0.3543636,0.08381508,-1.2934098,1.036994,0.6460951,-1.0003779,-1.270533,-0.68539965,0.5142778,-1.1614252,0.7948992,-0.33729553,-0.22344027,-0.34649536,0.2201313,0.1881407,0.19370212,1.8055965,-0.6204045,1.581024,0.8612311,-0.89790785,0.32582575,2.1107285,0.5170277,-0.49818233,0.7597945,0.4467746,-0.17921913,0.30194256,-0.7153379,-1.0440472,-0.17090356,-0.13621427,0.3616383,0.4168082,-0.2642317,-0.7389769,1.3424976,-0.0012106332,0.8029097,-0.41442314,0.2106664,0.21156934,-1.5655819,1.2993397,0.20666897,0.75546724,-0.4384693,0.48877698,-1.0442138,1.5574813,0.5337817,-0.15236469,-0.6138341,-1.1518415,-0.67545444,-0.90437055,0.46066648,-0.23381518,-0.9413516,2.0204554,0.1304692,1.1838692,-0.8514258,-0.6618194,0.76560843,1.0825168,-0.89412034,-0.29282072,0.25418955,-0.067297876,0.6219356,0.28781426,0.5301163,0.14762437,-1.0521089,-0.7243631,0.1441598